{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29893","headline":"谢往桂林至彤庭窃咏 · 李商隐","name":"谢往桂林至彤庭窃咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辰象森罗正，句陈翊卫宽。\n鱼龙排百戏，剑佩俨千官。\n城禁将开晚，宫深欲曙难。\n月输移枍诣，仙路下栏干。\n共贺高禖应，将陈寿酒欢。\n金星压芒角，银汉转波澜。\n王母来空阔，羲和上屈盘。\n凤皇传诏旨，獬廌冠朝端。\n造化中台座，威风上将坛。\n甘泉犹望幸，早晚冠呼韩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}